comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T18:53:26.967Z",codex-agent,Implementation and real-repository regression evidence linked. Review remains with the orchestrator; this item stays in progress.
  "2026-10-15T18:54:04.606Z",codex-agent,Git merge-tree executes configured pm item and history drivers. Two independently added SDK comments both survive in the merged item and history tree. Replacing the item driver with a failing command yields a tracker-path conflict. Driver receipts precede Git output; the predictor parses the NUL-delimited tree record and retains every unresolved tracker path. No source history is repaired or rewritten by simulation.
  "2026-10-15T19:02:32.565Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: replaced only predict with the pre-feature no-conflict behavior. The real three-lane same-line conflict regression failed with ERR_ASSERTION, exit 1. Restored exact function bytes. Disjoint-file and tracker-driver predictions pass in the complete suite."
